<title>DENMARK: Danish September new car yr/yr sales fell 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Danish September new car yr/yr sales fell 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations fell 4.3 percent in September to 9,834 from 10,278 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					Sept 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p>    New car registrations	 9,834     10,278</p>
<p>Leading September registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	 1,342</p>
<p>    Toyota		  1,230</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	   787</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp   670</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman,Copenhagen Newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
